## `.ai` strategy

Since `.ai` is expensive, reserve it for the one thing that must scream AI.

My pick:

```text
Buy .com/.systems/.dev for the durable base.
Buy exactly one .ai for the AI-facing flagship.
```

Possible `.ai` targets worth paying for only if available at normal, not premium, pricing:

```text
auroracorebridge.ai
aurorabridgeworks.ai
commandbridgeworks.ai
coredecksystems.ai
pykesys.ai
auroraseed.ai
```

But if `.ai` is painful, do not force it. For serious infrastructure, these are respectable:

```text
.systems
.dev
.io
.cloud
.tech
.engineering
.works
.network
```

For you, `.systems` is actually beautiful:

```text
pykesys.systems
gutierrez.systems
auroracommand.systems
aurorabridge.systems
coredeck.systems
```

It says “this is not a toy app; this is systems work.”

