## My read on “Pykesys”

| Dimension         | Read                                                                                      |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Memorability      | Good. Short, strange enough to stick.                                                     |
| Meaning           | Not obvious at first, but discoverable once explained.                                    |
| Technical feel    | Strong. The `sys` ending immediately hints at systems, Unix, infrastructure, engineering. |
| Brand personality | Old-school hacker shop, systems lab, independent engineer, not polished SaaS fluff.       |
| Weakness          | People may not know how to pronounce it or spell it after hearing it once.                |
