I would not use Pykesys as the public name for every Aurora concept. I would use it as the **holding company / engineering forge / founder lab**.

Like this:

```text
Pykesys
  owner / lab / engineering identity

Aurora Command Labs
  research and doctrine

Aurora Core Bridge
  product/interface platform

Aurora Seed
  prototype vessel / investment story
```

That creates a nice separation:

```text
Pykesys builds.
Aurora Command Labs researches.
Aurora Core Bridge operates.
Aurora Seed launches.
